    Bug 1976396 - Remove a dependency on nsIMsgMailNewsUrl in some PGP / S/MIME code. r=kaie


    This code tries to QI quite a few times to `nsIMsgMailNewsUrl` but doesn't
    actually use anything specific to that interface. This means EWS messages (which
    URIs are pure `nsIURI`s) would not display if they're encrypted or signed.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D257692

